# The load on demand half of ItemTree (brief U3). ItemTree keeps at login only the modules its
# tooltips, bag badges and collector read (its own Data\generated), and asks the client to load
# this addon the first time the window or a page needs the rest (Core/Data.lua Data:Get). Every
# file here registers into ItemTree's namespace through the global ItemTree (see the preamble of
# any module), and ItemTree_Data/Data/generated/EraSources.lua and BossLoot.lua are distributed
# under GPL-3.0 (data derived from the CMaNGOS Classic content database alone; EraPlaces.lua and
# BossLootIndex.lua beside them are ours): see ItemTree's LICENSE.
#
# The project ids above are ItemTree's own, so an addon manager reads this folder as part of the
# same project. X-WoWI-ID is deliberately absent: the packager takes the first value it finds in
# any TOC it reads, and ItemTree.toc leaves that line blank on purpose (docs/release.md).

Data\generated\Data.xml
